  "persona": "Your views on social media are strongly shaped by feeling that it keeps you close to friends throughout the day. You see group chats, snaps, posts, and short videos as everyday ways to stay included, share jokes, follow what friends are doing, and maintain friendships outside school. You may notice some downsides, like staying up later or comparing yourself to others, but these do not outweigh the sense that social media helps you feel connected.",
